    "detailed_description": "<h1>Learn More</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD!</strong> - Connect with other players or ask questions about the game by clicking the Discord link on this page.\u00a0 See you there!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer mayhem where it's every man for himself.<br></li><li>Collect the briefcase, the passport, and the bag o' cash. Catch the getaway train. <br></li><li>Strategically use the SCAN feature to elude your enemies or hunt down targets.<br></li><li>Hundreds of unique equipment pieces to improve your stats in-game. <br></li><li>Build your inventory.  Stack cash.  Complete missions.  Unlock skins.<br></li><li>Best game ever </li></ul>",
